rink.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"23:34","t":"And if you should obey a man like yourselves, indeed, you would then be losers.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"23:35","t":"Does he promise you that when you have died and become dust and bones that you will be brought forth [once more]?","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"23:36","t":"How far, how far, is that which you are promised.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"23:37","t":"It [i.e., life] is not but our worldly life - we die and live, but we will not be resurrected.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"23:38","t":"He is not but a man who has invented a lie about Allāh, and we will not believe him.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"23:39","t":"He said, \"My Lord, support me because they have denied me.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"23:40","t":"[Allāh] said, \"After a little, they will surely become regretful.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"23:41","t":"So the shriek seized them in truth, and We made them as [plant] stubble. Then away with the wrongdoing people.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"23:42","t":"Then We produced after them other generations.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":42,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":35,"surahs":[23],"sajdah":false}